    "detailed_description": "Super Sean 007 is a platform game with a great world. The world consists of various beautiful sceneries of nature: forests, caves, mountains, and abandoned ruins telling the stories of when there used to be a civilization there.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players will defeat various types of enemies.<br></li><li>Players will go through the level until all the main quest requirements in that level are finished. <br></li><li>If a player finished all the levels, the whole levels will be reset as the score would be displayed in personal best highscore.<br></li><li>Additions: Players are able to go back to the previous level if they are willing to finish the side quests through the teleport points.</li></ul>",
